{"4717990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy to Kill", "steam_appid": 4717990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5013530], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PARRY ENEMY ATTACKS IN A TURN BASED RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Parry attack animations during enemy turns in Real Time &amp; weave in hits to punish gaps in in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/f2d1c99ef343a647eedcb83ce553d3b5.poster.avif?t=1788173777\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/f2d1c99ef343a647eedcb83ce553d3b5.webm?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/f2d1c99ef343a647eedcb83ce553d3b5.mp4?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>REACTIVE TURN BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight monsters alongside your party in strategic turn-based combat. <br>Control 3 individual characters in your party and play turns to attack, use skill or aim shot with speed based initiative turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your team with RPG progression mechanics of learning new skills, equipping held items and leveling up characters and party with EXP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/c7e87ff793ced1479e84a8376066fd77.poster.avif?t=1788173777\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/c7e87ff793ced1479e84a8376066fd77.webm?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/c7e87ff793ced1479e84a8376066fd77.mp4?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ASCEND THE ABYSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a 2.5D overworld to route to encounters.<br>Ascend to higher floors in search of civilization in a oppressive dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/eacd6121908ff520d7956d97f7905760.poster.avif?t=1788173777\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/eacd6121908ff520d7956d97f7905760.webm?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/eacd6121908ff520d7956d97f7905760.mp4?t=1788173777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PARRY ENEMY ATTACKS IN A TURN BASED RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Parry attack animations during enemy turns in Real Time &amp; weave in hits to punish gaps in in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4717990/extras/f2d1c99ef343a647eed